mand, record its exit status and the decisive failure output, then take an explicit action: repair the implementation for an implementation defect, add or correct the regression test for missing coverage, repair the setup or document the blocked validation for an environment failure, and rerun the acceptance test to ensure unrelated failures did not mask the target result. Do not declare completion while the target reproducer remains unclassified or unvalidated.; revise only for actionable defects, rerun the failed command, and repeat this repair loop for a bounded number of iterations; and (6) inspect the complete diff as an independent reviewer. Compare the final diff against the patch contract and reject any change that is unexplained, unrelated, dead, overly broad, or missing from the intended files. Verify imports, formatting, public API compatibility, error behavior, edge cases, and that no debug code, generated artifacts, temporary files, or test-only workaround remains. Then inspect the repository status and confirm the final saved state contains the intended source and regression-test changes., verify that every changed line supports the issue and preserves compatibility, then re-run the acceptance tests and relevant regression tests from the final saved state. Finish only when you can report: the root cause, files and symbols changed, the exact reproducer command and passing result, the broader regression command and result or a clearly evidenced environment block, and how each acceptance criterion is satisfied. If any required item is missing, continue investigating and editing rather than submitting a speculative patch.ant regression tests before finishing. Do not treat an untested edit as a completed solution: completion requires a non-empty intended diff, the exact test commands, passing results, and a concise explanation linking each acceptance criterion to evidence; if any item is missing, continue investigating instead of submitting.
 
